Khord — Third-Party API Attribution
=====================================

This software makes use of the following third-party APIs and services.
Users who deploy or modify this software must preserve this attribution.

Odesli (song.link)
  Cross-platform music link resolution
  https://odesli.co
  Free API — attribution required per Odesli terms of service.
  Song pages link back to song.link as required.

Apple iTunes Search API
  Music search and metadata
  https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/AudioVideo/Conceptual/iTuneSearchAPI/
  Free API provided by Apple Inc.

Spotify Web API
  Music search and streaming link resolution
  https://developer.spotify.com
  Requires a Spotify developer account and active Premium subscription
  for client credentials flow. Subject to Spotify Developer Terms of Service.

AT Protocol / Bluesky
  Decentralized identity, record storage, and social graph
  https://atproto.com
  Open protocol developed by Bluesky PBC.

